{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CopilotKit/CopilotKit/pulls/3432","id":3392338125,"node_id":"PR_kwDOJxJfAc7KMvjN","html_url":"https://github.com/CopilotKit/CopilotKit/pull/3432","diff_url":"https://github.com/CopilotKit/CopilotKit/pull/3432.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/CopilotKit/CopilotKit/pull/3432.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CopilotKit/CopilotKit/issues/3432","number":3432,"state":"open","locked":false,"title":"feat: add optional agentId to useAgentContext","user":{"login":"mme","id":247775,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY4ODcyNDc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/247775?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mme","html_url":"https://github.com/mme","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mme/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mme/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mme/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mme/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mme/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mme/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mme/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mme/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mme/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"## Summary\n- Adds an optional `agentId` field to `useAgentContext` so context can be scoped to a specific agent\n- Context with an `agentId` is only forwarded to that agent; global context (no `agentId`) is sent to all agents\n- Mirrors the existing `agentId` scoping behavior of `useFrontendTool`\n- Introduces `FrontendContext` type (extends AG-UI `Context` with optional `agentId`), following the `FrontendTool` naming pattern\n\n## Test plan\n- [x] Unit tests: `useAgentContext` passes `agentId` through, re-registers on change, is idempotent when stable\n- [x] Core integration tests: `runAgent` and `connectA